{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1501871-stats-for-cthritae","id":1501871,"title":"Stats for Cthritae","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-02-01T08:13:29-08:00","id":1501871,"title":"Stats for Cthritae","content":"I'm about to send my players to a Gethamane and they will shortly encounter the cthritae that lurk below (I'm being kind by not introducing Vodak at this point). However, they lack stats for 3rd ed, I think. <br /> <br /> Does anyone have any stats for cthritae, giant centipedes, etc for 3rd ed that I might steal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4249-gribblethemunchkin","name":"gribblethemunchkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4249_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-01T09:33:23-08:00","id":1501876,"title":"","content":"I'd be inclined to mostly treat them like a ground based version of ichneumon hunters in that they're both ambush predators who lay their eggs in you.<br /> Main places where I see the cthritae differing based on their 2e write-up. <br /> <br /> lose- <br /> tiny creature,<br /> 1-2 points of evasion,<br /> distracting swarm,<br /> fly 7 dice<br /> <br /> gain-<br /> better soak (6-8),<br /> an extra -1 and -2 health level,<br /> better sense of smell (keen nose merit)<br /> burrowing 7 dice","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness